    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. like, why am i even trying so hard to be \"someone\" or make an impact when the city itself is just this giant machine that doesn't care if any single part is missing? it feels like everything i do is just... pointless. like i'm fighting to stay visible when it would be so much easier to just let go.",
