      "content": "i don't know... the \"thread\" thing sounds nice but it doesn't feel real. it just feels like more work. more effort to keep a role in a play that nobody's even watching. if the machine doesn't need me, isn't it just more logical to stop pretending? like, wouldn't it be more peaceful to just accept that the void is waiting and stop fighting it?",
